    "detailed_description": "<h1>\u5173\u6ce8\u6211</h1><p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Stay up to date with the latest news on Tricks of Gods and Ghosts: </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7\u5b98\u65b9\u5fae\u535a&amp;\u5c0f\u7ea2\u4e66&amp;b\u7ad9\uff1a\u4e94\u8089</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00b7QQ\u4e00\u7fa4:759718289(\u5df2\u6ee1\uff09</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >QQ\u4e8c\u7fa4\uff1a687243405</p></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6e38\u620f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Nan Sheng,</strong> an ancient matriarchal fantasy land teeming with gods, demons, and occasional modern marvels brought in by mysterious travelers. In this whimsical world, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of a <i>Tiqi</i> (elite enforcer) under the Zhenwu Bureau, bearing the Moon Emperor\u2019s secret decree to quell rising unrest among martial artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/465dd92728ee133d8a1d9ae77a71add0.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your destiny is yours to shape. Will you exploit your authority to spark turmoil and seize power? Or pursue a path of peace, protecting the innocent? Perhaps you\u2019ll claim the Mandate of Heaven itself. Embrace the chaos in this lighthearted RPG, where comedic madness and dramatic showdowns collide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/95dc68295cff07fdd0f17fdf091408ce.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Female-Dominant Setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nan Sheng\u2019s societal structure places women at the highest tiers of power. This alternate reality flips conventional historical norms on their head\u2014expect surprises around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Male Pregnancy\u201d &amp; Black-Box Biology</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True to its unconventional world, men can bear children in Nan Sheng. How? That\u2019s part of the fantasy! <i>There is no explicit discussion of anatomy</i>\u2014it\u2019s left intentionally vague for comedic effect and player interpretation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the martial realm, infiltrate political circles, or become a defender of the people. Your actions will influence shifting allegiances\u2014from sworn enemies to star-crossed allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/95462b2daa54592e7038fd1d54952538.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Fishing for Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>80+ distinct fish</strong> across freshwater, saltwater, magma pools, and icy lakes. Some fish can be sold, some are edible, and some are quest items. Plus, you might stumble upon random events or NPC interactions while fishing! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/74ff0f01ada15a3726c103486d60560e.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=339 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/74ff0f01ada15a3726c103486d60560e.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/4b771ae0b42509690176833a4ad35617.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span>There will be three types of seeds in the game. These are regular seeds from the store, exotic seeds sold by foxes, and fantasy seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players watering certain fantasy plants will trigger some random plot. For example, a certain poisonous flower may cause you to fall into a brief hallucination when watering it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/e145a727cd0d3e48e7473d5abc1baefd.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=339 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/e145a727cd0d3e48e7473d5abc1baefd.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ecd7af02af45b4d3d5f2b69b2cbb54a1.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Light COC-Style Skill Checks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on dice rolls for certain actions\u2014like using the <i>Listen</i> skill to eavesdrop on gossip. Most scenarios hinge on simple success or failure, though a handful may lead to spectacular triumphs or disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/068eecc21de9aa9b86415f068228b543.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/068eecc21de9aa9b86415f068228b543.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/068eecc21de9aa9b86415f068228b543.mp4?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/b658113a69c24969fa477cbe3db4da9d.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Straightforward Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with decent strength. Switch weapons for melee attacks, summon a mechanical hawk, or toss landmines\u2014simple controls ensure easy-to-learn battles that still pack a punch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ddac58d8aa13ecfa5b9cc228c526bb29.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ddac58d8aa13ecfa5b9cc228c526bb29.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ddac58d8aa13ecfa5b9cc228c526bb29.mp4?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/6f48afdd36a39ad83aa8062317b27be3.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Diverse Relationships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge unique bonds with multiple romance options <strong>including both male and female characters (and occasionally more unusual genders, too)</strong>. Pursue pure love, gather a grand harem, or wage a thrilling love-hate rivalry. Each character has their own moral code and might even oppose you\u2014choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/3652ed626bc2870fd1f1264a2fca5297.avif?t=1754294540\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/259f8a767ae3b77ad7b6701f93fd50c2.avif?t=1754294540\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/8b68eb5bd95150e0599b79356481bee0.avif?t=1754294540\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Important Disclaimer</strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is <strong>all-ages</strong> with no explicit content, despite the unconventional themes.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All main characters are 18+</strong> to avoid any misunderstandings about age.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The focus is on humor, drama, and storytelling over realism or explicit depictions.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Additional Considerations </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Matriarchal Context </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nan Sheng is a <i>woman-led society</i>, which may differ from typical historical or fantasy settings. Expect role reversals in power dynamics, social norms, and cultural expectations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fantasy \u201cMale Pregnancy\u201d </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While the game includes a \u201cmale pregnancy\u201d mechanic, it remains purely fantastical and comedic. We leave it intentionally vague (\u201cblack box biology\u201d)\u2014there\u2019s no graphic or detailed depiction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>All-Characters-Are-Adults </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In many regions, an \u201c18+\u201d label implies adult content. Here, it simply means every character is <strong>legally an adult</strong>; the story itself contains no explicit sexual scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedic &amp; Lighthearted </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect a blend of comedic anachronisms, over-the-top plot twists, and dramatic flair. It is <strong>not</strong> a historically accurate simulation but rather a fantastical, melodramatic escapade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance Variety </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>romance both male and female characters</strong>, alongside the possibility of more unconventional genders. Relationships may remain platonic, turn into devoted one-on-one romance, or veer into dramatic harems and rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Developer </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This entire project is created and managed by one person. Please understand that updates and replies to community questions may take time. We appreciate your patience and feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the absurd and dive into this blend of martial intrigue, comedic chaos, and \u201cdog-blood\u201d drama. <strong>Tricks\u00a0of\u00a0Gods\u00a0and\u00a0Ghosts</strong> invites you to craft your own legend in a land where anything can happen\u2014and probably will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >\u5173\u4e8e\u8fd9\u6b3e\u6e38\u620f</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Welcome to Nan Sheng,</strong> an ancient matriarchal fantasy land teeming with gods, demons, and occasional modern marvels brought in by mysterious travelers. In this whimsical world, you\u2019ll step into the shoes of a <i>Tiqi</i> (elite enforcer) under the Zhenwu Bureau, bearing the Moon Emperor\u2019s secret decree to quell rising unrest among martial artists.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >  </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/465dd92728ee133d8a1d9ae77a71add0.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=99 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Your destiny is yours to shape. Will you exploit your authority to spark turmoil and seize power? Or pursue a path of peace, protecting the innocent? Perhaps you\u2019ll claim the Mandate of Heaven itself. Embrace the chaos in this lighthearted RPG, where comedic madness and dramatic showdowns collide!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/95dc68295cff07fdd0f17fdf091408ce.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>-Female-Dominant Setting</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Nan Sheng\u2019s societal structure places women at the highest tiers of power. This alternate reality flips conventional historical norms on their head\u2014expect surprises around every corner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Male Pregnancy\u201d &amp; Black-Box Biology</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >True to its unconventional world, men can bear children in Nan Sheng. How? That\u2019s part of the fantasy! <i>There is no explicit discussion of anatomy</i>\u2014it\u2019s left intentionally vague for comedic effect and player interpretation.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Roam the martial realm, infiltrate political circles, or become a defender of the people. Your actions will influence shifting allegiances\u2014from sworn enemies to star-crossed allies.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/95462b2daa54592e7038fd1d54952538.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Fishing for Fun</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Encounter <strong>80+ distinct fish</strong> across freshwater, saltwater, magma pools, and icy lakes. Some fish can be sold, some are edible, and some are quest items. Plus, you might stumble upon random events or NPC interactions while fishing! </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/74ff0f01ada15a3726c103486d60560e.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=339 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/74ff0f01ada15a3726c103486d60560e.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/4b771ae0b42509690176833a4ad35617.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span>There will be three types of seeds in the game. These are regular seeds from the store, exotic seeds sold by foxes, and fantasy seeds.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Players watering certain fantasy plants will trigger some random plot. For example, a certain poisonous flower may cause you to fall into a brief hallucination when watering it.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/e145a727cd0d3e48e7473d5abc1baefd.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=339 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/e145a727cd0d3e48e7473d5abc1baefd.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ecd7af02af45b4d3d5f2b69b2cbb54a1.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=96 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Light COC-Style Skill Checks</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Rely on dice rolls for certain actions\u2014like using the <i>Listen</i> skill to eavesdrop on gossip. Most scenarios hinge on simple success or failure, though a handful may lead to spectacular triumphs or disasters.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/068eecc21de9aa9b86415f068228b543.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=340 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/068eecc21de9aa9b86415f068228b543.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/068eecc21de9aa9b86415f068228b543.mp4?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/b658113a69c24969fa477cbe3db4da9d.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Straightforward Combat</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You start with decent strength. Switch weapons for melee attacks, summon a mechanical hawk, or toss landmines\u2014simple controls ensure easy-to-learn battles that still pack a punch.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ddac58d8aa13ecfa5b9cc228c526bb29.poster.avif?t=1754294540\" width=600 height=332 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ddac58d8aa13ecfa5b9cc228c526bb29.webm?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/ddac58d8aa13ecfa5b9cc228c526bb29.mp4?t=1754294540\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/6f48afdd36a39ad83aa8062317b27be3.avif?t=1754294540\" width=620 height=100 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >-<strong>Diverse Relationships</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forge unique bonds with multiple romance options <strong>including both male and female characters (and occasionally more unusual genders, too)</strong>. Pursue pure love, gather a grand harem, or wage a thrilling love-hate rivalry. Each character has their own moral code and might even oppose you\u2014choose wisely.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2697490/extras/3652ed626bc2870fd1f1264a2fca5297.avif?t=1754294540\" data-has-big width=800 height=450 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"h