t content. Here, it simply means every character is <strong>legally an adult</strong>; the story itself contains no explicit sexual scenes.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Comedic &amp; Lighthearted </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expect a blend of comedic anachronisms, over-the-top plot twists, and dramatic flair. It is <strong>not</strong> a historically accurate simulation but rather a fantastical, melodramatic escapade.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Romance Variety </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can <strong>romance both male and female characters</strong>, alongside the possibility of more unconventional genders. Relationships may remain platonic, turn into devoted one-on-one romance, or veer into dramatic harems and rivalries.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solo Developer </strong></p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This entire project is created and managed by one person. Please understand that updates and replies to community questions may take time. We appreciate your patience and feedback!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p></li></ul></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embrace the absurd and dive into this blend of martial intrigue, comedic chaos, and \u201cdog-blood\u201d drama. <strong>Tricks\u00a0of\u00a0Gods\u00a0and\u00a0Ghosts</strong> invites you to craft your own legend in a land where anything can happen\u2014and probably will!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>",
